Commercial license requests are described in `COMMERCIAL_LICENSE.md`.

ControlWork originated as the Project Plane inside ControlCoding and is now a
standalone source-available noncommercial product that remains compatible with
the embedded Project Plane in ControlCoding.

Compatibility does not merge product identity or remove license boundaries.
ControlCoding and ControlWork components both require separate written
commercial permission for commercial use.

Historical note: versions previously released under MIT, CC-BY-SA, or other
terms remain governed by the terms under which those versions were published.
This license describes this repository state and future versions unless a later
release states otherwise.

When a file has a more specific SPDX or license notice, that file-level notice
controls for that file.

