## Product Boundary

ControlCoding covers methodology, host context, hooks, CLI tools, local memory,
verification gates, agent-facing structure, and coding governance.

ControlWork covers portable Work Plane / Project Plane memory, including
`CONTROLWORK.md`, `.controlwork/`, source review, decisions, plans, outputs,
graph projections, retrieval, handoff packets, context packets, and compatible
standalone or embedded workflows.

ControlWork compatibility with ControlCoding does not relicense either product
as open source. Embedded, imported, synced, or exported ControlWork components
keep the ControlWork noncommercial license boundary.

## Attribution Requirement

Any shared copy, fork, modified version, package collection, or redistribution
of repository material must preserve visible attribution:

ControlCoding by Stefano Tonello
https://github.com/Naimas/ControlCoding

Modified versions must clearly state that they are modified and must not imply
that they are official ControlCoding or ControlWork releases unless explicitly
approved in writing by Stefano Tonello.
